[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_us6gg"]
script = ExtResource("4_edend")
lines = "Inn
The coaching inn is a modest affair, favoring simple comfort over gaudy luxury. It would be downright cosy, were it not for the dark mood that seems to hang in the air. The innkeeper is at the front counter, regarding you with trepidition. You introduce yourselves and ask about the previous team. The innkeeper nods in recognition, but remains tense.
\"Aye, that lot came through 'ere about a few weeks ago. We've cleaned up their rooms and stowed their luggage since then, though,\" he explains. When asked to show you the stored luggage, he obliges and leads you to a storage area by the pantries."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://qiibr5iabuqw"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_xbfat"]
script = ExtResource("3_h0akf")
image = ExtResource("2_2xjdt")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://40q0ab7v28b4"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_uhd8p"]
script = ExtResource("4_edend")
lines = "The last team's luggage is stacked in a corner of the storage area, and has been for a while, given the thin film of dust on them. On closer inspection, the locks on the trunks have clearly been forced open. Even a cursory examination of their contents tells you they've been picked clean of anything remotely of value.
With that revelation, the reason for the innkeeper's unease is clear, as he is likely the one who looted the luggage. The question at hand now is how to deal with the crook."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://qiibr5iabuqw"

